-- v1371: Seed / sample data — Sanity Checks (v1370) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-09: 10 sample sanity check runs for project SEED334-PRJ-08 (fictional "Northbridge
-- Bank"), following the SIT build history of the other samples: build 1.0.12 rejected, 1.0.13 accepted with
-- an issue, an environment refresh, builds 1.0.14 and 1.0.15, a parameter change, build 1.0.16 running now,
-- and the planned data refresh, SIT Cycle 1 entry gate and UAT entry gate. Each run lists its seven smoke
-- checks with results, the interfaces checked, the outcome and defects raised. Vendor-neutral (rule 26);
-- person fields are plain text. display_id = '' so Admin ID Generation assigns it (rule 16.2).
-- Fixed hex-only ids …-4000-b040-… (range checked free before use); ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING; nothing
-- inserted if the project is missing. The final query lists the records, so a skipped insert is visible.
-- Prerequisites: v1370. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

